WEBVTT

00:23.840 --> 00:28.839
(Based on Softstar Technology
single-player game "Chinese Paladin 3")

00:28.840 --> 00:35.359
(Copyright Notice)

00:35.360 --> 00:36.879
(Viewers under the age of majority
should watch with guardian permission.)

00:36.880 --> 00:38.689
(The content depicted in this film
is fictional.)

00:38.690 --> 00:40.520
(Do not imitate in real life.)

00:58.820 --> 01:01.789
♪Blades of wind cut through dark clouds,
sunset flares to life♪

01:01.790 --> 01:04.060
♪Staining the vast sky red♪

01:04.550 --> 01:09.720
♪A fierce spirit forges a sacred sword,
unafraid of demons♪

01:10.300 --> 01:13.089
♪Breaking the heavens,
shattering the shrouded dark♪

01:13.090 --> 01:15.959
♪Breaking the dream,
thorns blinding the way♪

01:15.960 --> 01:18.379
♪Breaking love,
trapped in hatred and obsession♪

01:18.380 --> 01:21.129
♪The sword's edge ignites
with burning blood♪

01:21.130 --> 01:24.109
♪Fight to the fullest♪

01:24.110 --> 01:26.899
♪Burn to the fullest♪

01:26.900 --> 01:29.689
♪For the one I love♪

01:29.690 --> 01:32.439
♪No regrets whether laughter or tears♪

01:32.440 --> 01:35.239
♪I never stop searching♪

01:35.240 --> 01:38.460
♪I never stop falling♪

01:41.020 --> 01:44.130
♪A furious roar shakes the earth
and pierces the sky♪

01:53.760 --> 01:56.799
=Sword and Fairy 3=

01:56.800 --> 01:59.040
=Episode 3=
=Tang Clan Upheaval: Part One=

02:02.720 --> 02:04.559
I never imagined members
of the Tang Family Fort

02:04.560 --> 02:07.210
would sink so low as to collude
with heretical sects like Thunder Hall.

02:09.540 --> 02:11.820
When I return,
I will tell Grandpa and Third Uncle.

02:12.140 --> 02:14.060
They will never spare this traitor.

02:14.420 --> 02:16.949
Those demonized Thunder Hall disciples
are highly unusual.

02:16.950 --> 02:18.490
You must all be extra cautious.

02:18.700 --> 02:19.820
Mm.

02:22.050 --> 02:23.180
Zi Xuan.

02:23.580 --> 02:26.580
You and Changqing have known each other
for a long time, haven't you?

02:28.820 --> 02:31.180
You must have many stories together.

02:31.820 --> 02:32.829
Zi Xuan.

02:32.830 --> 02:33.820
Tell me about them.

02:36.230 --> 02:37.480
Half a year ago,

02:38.020 --> 02:41.940
I met Changqing while gathering herbs
in the forest near Shu Mountain.

02:43.060 --> 02:44.700
While pursuing the Demon Clan,

02:44.780 --> 02:46.620
he mistakenly wandered into
a poisonous miasma.

02:54.430 --> 02:57.500
♪Old dreams sway softly♪

02:57.580 --> 03:00.769
♪Snow falls in silence on Shu Mountain♪

03:00.770 --> 03:02.219
A beauty saving a hero.

03:02.220 --> 03:03.889
♪Candlelight trembles♪

03:03.890 --> 03:05.199
What a tale to be told.

03:05.200 --> 03:09.320
♪Casting her weary brow in glow♪

03:09.560 --> 03:12.999
♪Memories surge like tides♪

03:13.000 --> 03:16.780
♪A love across three lives
left unresolved♪

03:16.800 --> 03:20.129
♪Peach blossoms in turmoil♪

03:20.130 --> 03:24.429
♪Longing still burns within♪

03:24.430 --> 03:27.339
♪Now she is gone♪

03:27.340 --> 03:31.780
♪Time rests in hollow calm♪

03:31.870 --> 03:35.399
♪A bond of three lifetimes♪

03:35.400 --> 03:39.380
♪Flowers bloom then wither again♪

03:39.430 --> 03:42.490
♪Spring fades into autumn♪

03:42.740 --> 03:44.220
It is you.

03:46.830 --> 03:48.790
I dreamed of you again.

03:49.400 --> 03:55.600
♪Fate remains beyond knowing♪

04:00.100 --> 04:01.439
Hey, Zi Xuan.

04:01.440 --> 04:04.140
Then how did you
and Changqing end up here?

04:05.460 --> 04:08.500
Later, Changqing resolved to marry me.

04:08.580 --> 04:11.700
When his master, Qing Wei,
learned of it, he was furious

04:11.780 --> 04:13.460
and expelled him from the sect.

04:13.900 --> 04:15.940
After Changqing and I left Shu Mountain,

04:15.980 --> 04:19.670
we planned to seek out Shang Fengzi, the clan master
of Penglai, to plead on his behalf,

04:20.180 --> 04:22.340
hoping to ease Qing Wei's anger

04:22.860 --> 04:24.900
so he could return to Shu Mountain.

04:25.160 --> 04:28.000
Oh, I see.

04:29.280 --> 04:31.859
I really envy you, being able
to travel the martial world together,

04:31.860 --> 04:34.600
slaying demons and banishing evil,

04:34.740 --> 04:36.460
being a pair of immortal companions.

04:37.140 --> 04:38.339
One day,

04:38.340 --> 04:40.980
you will surely
meet your destined one as well.

04:41.420 --> 04:43.500
Perhaps it will be...

04:45.140 --> 04:46.339
Of course not.

04:46.340 --> 04:49.380
I... I could never fall for him.

04:50.200 --> 04:53.059
Xuejian, look. I just mastered
a new cultivation method.

04:53.060 --> 04:55.220
When I wield the sword,
it feels effortless now.

04:55.260 --> 04:56.299
I am not dizzy anymore.

04:56.300 --> 04:57.440
No.

05:00.740 --> 05:02.400
So silly.

05:04.580 --> 05:06.500
What is wrong with her?

05:14.660 --> 05:15.780
Changqing.

05:16.740 --> 05:18.590
Last night, I sensed disturbances
at Shu Mountain,

05:18.590 --> 05:20.080
earth calamities
occurring again and again.

05:20.140 --> 05:24.180
And today, we encountered these
Thunder Hall disciples using demonic arts.

05:25.260 --> 05:28.900
I am worried that something has gone wrong
at the Demon-Sealing Pagoda.

05:32.020 --> 05:33.300
You should return.

05:34.140 --> 05:35.260
And you?

05:35.460 --> 05:38.220
Those demonized Thunder Hall disciples
are highly unusual.

05:38.300 --> 05:40.140
I need to investigate further.

05:40.500 --> 05:42.100
No matter the outcome,

05:42.300 --> 05:43.980
we will meet again at Shu Mountain.

05:44.060 --> 05:45.180
All right.

05:46.020 --> 05:46.819
Tian.

05:46.820 --> 05:47.459
Huh?

05:47.460 --> 05:48.980
What will you do next?

05:49.140 --> 05:51.740
The people of the Tang Family Fort
are especially harsh toward Xuejian.

05:51.940 --> 05:53.419
If I am not by her side,

05:53.420 --> 05:55.260
I am afraid she
will be taken advantage of.

05:56.940 --> 05:57.810
That is fine.

05:58.060 --> 05:59.739
Changqing and I
still have urgent matters,

05:59.740 --> 06:01.340
so we cannot go with you.

06:01.660 --> 06:03.739
With you accompanying Xuejian
to the Tang Family Fort,

06:03.740 --> 06:05.179
we can be more at ease.

06:05.180 --> 06:06.100
Tian.

06:06.140 --> 06:08.300
This is a Shu Mountain Talisman.

06:08.460 --> 06:09.940
Should you encounter danger,

06:10.020 --> 06:11.620
it may help you escape safely.

06:11.900 --> 06:13.259
In the days ahead,

06:13.260 --> 06:14.940
I will teach you as much as I can,

06:15.060 --> 06:16.880
so you will have the means
to protect yourselves.

06:17.140 --> 06:18.260
Tian.

06:18.580 --> 06:20.140
You must be diligent.

06:20.420 --> 06:21.780
Thank you, Changqing.

06:22.340 --> 06:25.209
♪Blades of wind cut through dark clouds,
sunset flares to life♪

06:25.210 --> 06:27.430
♪Staining the vast sky red♪

06:27.840 --> 06:30.369
♪Breaking love,
trapped in hatred and obsession♪

06:30.370 --> 06:33.319
♪The sword's edge ignites
with burning blood♪

06:33.320 --> 06:36.169
♪Fight to the fullest♪

06:36.170 --> 06:38.059
♪Burn to the fullest♪

06:38.060 --> 06:40.979
Tian, your natural talent
and foundation are exceptional.

06:40.980 --> 06:43.260
With these days of training,
you can already defend yourself.

06:43.260 --> 06:46.700
Remember, your strength
must be used for the righteous path.

06:47.080 --> 06:50.920
♪I never stop falling♪

06:52.920 --> 06:56.510
♪A furious roar shakes the earth
and pierces the sky♪

06:59.020 --> 07:01.120
(Thunder Hall, Underground Palace)
Thanks to the Immortal Master's guidance,

07:01.120 --> 07:03.220
my cultivation has greatly advanced.

07:08.420 --> 07:10.779
As for what I mentioned earlier,

07:10.780 --> 07:13.540
(Luo Rulie)
when will you deliver?

07:13.700 --> 07:17.340
Rest assured. I have already
sent disciples to handle it.

07:17.940 --> 07:19.340
Luo Rulie.

07:20.060 --> 07:22.459
As long as you
carry out what I instructed,

07:22.460 --> 07:25.140
I will help strengthen your cultivation.

07:25.980 --> 07:30.980
In the future, even ruling the martial world
will be within your grasp.

07:34.620 --> 07:37.620
I heard Hall Master Luo received guidance
from a powerful expert.

07:37.750 --> 07:38.979
Does that mean

07:38.980 --> 07:40.860
you no longer
need the Five Poison Pearl?

07:45.180 --> 07:48.140
Missing our appointment this time
was indeed my fault.

07:48.340 --> 07:49.860
As an apology,

08:06.300 --> 08:07.420
This...

08:08.100 --> 08:10.619
Since the two of us
have already formed an alliance,

08:10.620 --> 08:12.739
there should be some trust between us.

08:12.740 --> 08:13.860
Ah?

08:18.860 --> 08:19.980
Ah!

08:23.220 --> 08:24.499
May I ask

08:24.500 --> 08:25.980
what kind of elixir is this?

08:26.060 --> 08:28.260
Please grant me another one.

08:28.580 --> 08:30.100
Be patient.

08:30.340 --> 08:32.300
I have already made arrangements.

08:33.580 --> 08:36.900
Return to the Tang Family Fort
and see the task through.

08:37.500 --> 08:41.580
When the time comes, Tang Family Fort
will be absorbed into the Thunder Hall branch.

08:41.820 --> 08:44.980
Together, the two of us
will dominate the martial world.

08:45.860 --> 08:47.499
As for this elixir,

08:47.500 --> 08:50.020
you may have as much as you want.

08:50.220 --> 08:51.959
Yes.

08:51.960 --> 08:53.300
However, this time,

08:53.340 --> 08:55.790
there is one more matter
I need you to handle.

08:56.710 --> 08:57.900
I understand.

08:58.300 --> 09:02.899
Please help me seize the position
of clan master this time.

09:02.900 --> 09:04.660
Hahaha!

09:04.740 --> 09:06.380
Sure.

09:14.140 --> 09:15.940
The Five Poison Pearl.

09:16.380 --> 09:16.939
Yes.

09:16.940 --> 09:19.079
(Tang Family Fort)

09:19.080 --> 09:22.060
At last, I get to
see the Tang Family Fort for myself.

09:22.120 --> 09:24.160
You have no idea,
the last time I came looking for you,

09:24.160 --> 09:25.960
the gatekeeper refused to
let me in no matter what.

09:25.960 --> 09:28.459
Do not worry. From now on,

09:28.460 --> 09:31.470
I have got you covered.
No one will stop you.

09:31.720 --> 09:33.419
(Assembly Hall)

09:33.420 --> 09:36.340
Tang Yi, you are merely a junior
born of a concubine.

09:36.620 --> 09:39.130
(Tang Zhen)
What right do you have to be clan master?

09:39.980 --> 09:41.140
What right?

09:41.340 --> 09:43.499
The ancestral rules
of the Tang Family Fort

09:43.500 --> 09:45.800
that whoever is acknowledged
by the Five Poison Immortal Beast

09:45.800 --> 09:47.739
is the clan master of Tang Family Fort.

09:47.740 --> 09:49.060
The Five Poison Immortal Beast?

09:49.860 --> 09:50.620
Hua Ying.

09:50.700 --> 09:51.899
What have you done to Hua Ying?

09:51.900 --> 09:53.100
Release it at once!

09:55.820 --> 09:58.220
So it is the young lady.

09:59.060 --> 10:00.619
(Tang Tai)
Xuejian.

10:00.620 --> 10:02.220
Where did you run off to?

10:02.260 --> 10:04.020
Everyone has been looking for you.

10:05.060 --> 10:07.340
Third Uncle.
You have all been deceived by him.

10:07.460 --> 10:09.139
Tang Yi is a traitor
to the Tang Family Fort.

10:09.140 --> 10:09.980
Hmph.

10:10.430 --> 10:12.030
Watch your words.

10:12.340 --> 10:14.860
The Five Poison Immortal Beast
has acknowledged me as its master.

10:14.900 --> 10:17.700
That makes me the new clan master
of the Tang Family Fort.

10:18.970 --> 10:20.420
The new clan master?

10:20.850 --> 10:22.090
Then where is my grandpa?

10:23.500 --> 10:24.620
Xuejian.

10:25.020 --> 10:27.940
Do not think you are
still the Tang family's young lady.

10:28.180 --> 10:30.260
Without the former clan master backing you,

10:30.420 --> 10:32.979
you have no say left in the Tang Family.

10:32.980 --> 10:34.100
Tang Yi.

10:34.700 --> 10:36.499
These petty, despicable tricks of yours

10:36.500 --> 10:38.060
are utterly revolting.

10:38.380 --> 10:39.419
Those Thunder Hall lackeys

10:39.420 --> 10:40.860
have already been wiped out.

10:40.990 --> 10:42.220
What support do you have left?

10:43.980 --> 10:47.740
Everyone. Tang Yi used forbidden arts
to control the Five Poison Immortal Beast.

10:48.220 --> 10:50.420
He also colluded
with the fiends of Thunder Hall.

10:51.580 --> 10:53.780
Colluded with fiends?

10:53.900 --> 10:55.140
Fiends?

10:55.260 --> 10:56.620
What fiends are you talking about?

10:57.180 --> 10:58.969
You need proof when you speak.

10:58.970 --> 11:00.970
- Do not make false accusations.
- You...

11:01.660 --> 11:02.780
Third Uncle.

11:02.940 --> 11:04.139
Every word I said is true.

11:04.140 --> 11:05.619
Xuejian.

11:05.620 --> 11:08.059
It is not that I do not believe you.

11:08.060 --> 11:11.340
This is precisely why we are all here.

11:12.860 --> 11:14.300
The former clan master

11:14.420 --> 11:16.099
is gravely ill.

11:16.100 --> 11:17.980
He is near the end.

11:19.420 --> 11:20.540
What?

11:20.660 --> 11:21.780
Grandpa.

11:23.500 --> 11:24.579
You all...

11:24.580 --> 11:26.500
Instead of staying by his side
and caring for him,

11:26.500 --> 11:28.280
you are here fighting over
the clan master position.

11:28.280 --> 11:30.580
We are also acting
for the former clan master's sake.

11:30.820 --> 11:34.379
So that he no longer has to worry himself
over the Tang Family,

11:34.380 --> 11:35.980
and can focus on recovering in peace.

11:36.900 --> 11:38.619
Where is Grandpa, exactly?

11:38.620 --> 11:41.099
I want to see Grandpa.

11:41.100 --> 11:42.179
How dare you!

11:42.180 --> 11:44.499
(Eighth Aunt)
Why do you only know how to cause trouble?

11:44.500 --> 11:48.299
Children are always so immature.
You do not understand what truly matters.

11:48.300 --> 11:51.339
The former clan master
would not want the Tang Clan

11:51.340 --> 11:53.259
leaderless and thrown into chaos.

11:53.260 --> 11:55.140
- Exactly.
- That is right.

11:55.780 --> 11:56.900
You all...

11:57.340 --> 11:59.179
How can you treat Grandpa like this?

11:59.180 --> 12:00.300
Enough.

12:00.340 --> 12:02.579
In any case, the position
of clan master should naturally...

12:02.580 --> 12:04.579
Naturally belong to Tang Xuejian.

12:04.580 --> 12:05.740
Jing Tian, you...

12:06.820 --> 12:07.739
Honored elders,

12:07.740 --> 12:09.099
I am the young lady's attendant.

12:09.100 --> 12:10.549
Just call me Tian.

12:10.550 --> 12:11.970
I heard everything just now.

12:12.700 --> 12:14.040
According to Tang Clan rules,

12:14.040 --> 12:16.400
whoever the Five Poison Immortal Beast
acknowledges is the clan master,

12:16.400 --> 12:17.340
is that correct?

12:21.380 --> 12:24.860
Listen to me. Once you become clan master,
no one can stop you.

12:25.080 --> 12:27.580
Tang Yi, do you dare release Hua Ying

12:28.060 --> 12:29.299
and see whether it recognizes me?

12:29.300 --> 12:30.379
Hmph.

12:30.380 --> 12:32.299
Who knows what scheme you are plotting?

12:32.300 --> 12:33.740
I am not that foolish.

12:34.460 --> 12:36.620
You are clearly afraid.

12:36.740 --> 12:37.860
Enough.

12:38.180 --> 12:40.180
Since Tang Yi does not dare,

12:40.860 --> 12:44.459
then this so-called recognition
by the immortal beast cannot be counted.

12:44.460 --> 12:45.339
On what grounds?

12:45.340 --> 12:45.819
Ah!

12:45.820 --> 12:47.259
Third Uncle makes a fair point.

12:47.260 --> 12:49.019
- Exactly.
- The matter of clan master cannot be treated lightly.

12:49.020 --> 12:50.140
How about this?

12:50.580 --> 12:54.299
If the two of you truly wish to compete
for the position of clan master,

12:54.300 --> 12:56.900
then you must
rely on your own abilities.

12:57.540 --> 12:59.020
Let us see who prevails.

12:59.700 --> 13:01.860
- Then let us compete.
- Who is afraid of whom?

13:02.020 --> 13:02.940
Compete!

13:09.340 --> 13:10.259
First round.

13:10.260 --> 13:11.620
Mechanism Arts.

13:11.700 --> 13:13.659
This is the Ziwu Xuanji Box.

13:13.660 --> 13:16.179
It represents the pinnacle
of Tang Clan mechanism arts.

13:16.180 --> 13:19.819
Whoever opens it first
within one incense stick wins.

13:19.820 --> 13:20.980
I will go first.

13:22.980 --> 13:24.100
Eighth Aunt.

13:24.220 --> 13:26.260
Do you think Tang Yi can manage it?

13:28.660 --> 13:29.820
Unlikely.

13:29.860 --> 13:32.179
He does have some talent,

13:32.180 --> 13:35.940
but only past clan masters
have ever opened that box.

13:41.540 --> 13:42.900
Tang Yi has failed.

13:43.140 --> 13:44.259
Tang Xuejian.

13:44.260 --> 13:45.540
It is your turn.

13:47.180 --> 13:49.499
Can Tang Xuejian really do it?

13:49.500 --> 13:51.180
Do not forget,

13:51.300 --> 13:53.660
although her poison mastery is lacking,

13:53.820 --> 13:57.019
her mechanism skills were personally
taught by the former clan master.

13:57.020 --> 14:00.380
(This kind of Xuanji Box
should correspond to specific hours.)

14:00.500 --> 14:02.740
(The mechanisms
must be turned to different angles.)

14:02.900 --> 14:04.579
I wonder if that old man

14:04.580 --> 14:07.540
ever told Tang Xuejian this secret.

14:31.900 --> 14:33.059
Time is almost up.

14:33.060 --> 14:34.740
If you cannot do it, give up now.

14:39.340 --> 14:41.740
Wow, it is open.

14:41.780 --> 14:44.020
Just dumb luck.

14:44.100 --> 14:46.820
She really opened it. Impressive.

14:46.860 --> 14:49.300
First round. Xuejian wins.

14:49.660 --> 14:50.819
Second round.

14:50.820 --> 14:51.939
Detoxification.

14:51.940 --> 14:54.979
Third Uncle will administer
the Tang Clan's lethal poison.

14:54.980 --> 14:56.939
Within one incense stick,

14:56.940 --> 14:58.819
the antidote must be found in Baidu Hall.

14:58.820 --> 15:00.660
Otherwise, death will be immediate.

15:01.220 --> 15:03.580
Which of you will go first?

15:04.140 --> 15:05.260
Xuejian.

15:05.860 --> 15:07.620
You go first.

15:08.860 --> 15:12.379
Tang Xuejian never learned
the Tang Clan's orthodox poison arts.

15:12.380 --> 15:13.800
She is bound to lose this round.

15:14.660 --> 15:19.180
I want to see whether she even dares
to drink Third Uncle's poison.

15:32.900 --> 15:34.020
I will do it.

15:35.700 --> 15:36.579
Jing Tian.

15:36.580 --> 15:39.540
Leave poison testing to the attendant.

15:39.680 --> 15:41.779
You just focus on finding the antidote.
I can hold out.

15:41.780 --> 15:43.739
Well, at least he knows
how to treat a lady gently.

15:43.740 --> 15:44.780
Boy.

15:44.820 --> 15:46.500
Have you thought this through?

15:46.820 --> 15:49.979
If Xuejian fails to find the antidote,
you will lose your life.

15:49.980 --> 15:51.340
I trust her.

15:52.760 --> 15:55.089
You really are as lucky as ever,

15:55.090 --> 15:56.820
picking up a fool like this.

15:57.060 --> 15:59.860
Then stop wasting time and begin.

16:05.820 --> 16:06.980
Third Uncle.

16:07.300 --> 16:09.940
I concede this round.

16:11.780 --> 16:12.579
Xuejian.

16:12.580 --> 16:13.580
You...

16:15.350 --> 16:17.300
I cannot let you risk your life for me.

16:19.940 --> 16:21.139
Second round.

16:21.140 --> 16:23.220
Tang Xuejian withdraws.

16:23.340 --> 16:24.900
Tang Yi wins.

16:27.460 --> 16:30.100
Third round. Martial combat.

16:33.020 --> 16:35.339
Whoever slays the poisonous creature

16:35.340 --> 16:36.460
will be declared the winner.

16:40.700 --> 16:42.060
That is unfair.

16:42.340 --> 16:44.379
We just finished a poison trial
in the second round.

16:44.380 --> 16:46.019
We already conceded that one.

16:46.020 --> 16:47.950
And now this round still involves poison?

16:48.220 --> 16:49.659
You are clearly siding with Tang Yi.

16:49.660 --> 16:50.219
Boy, you...

16:50.220 --> 16:51.260
Enough.

16:51.380 --> 16:52.339
Do not argue anymore.

16:52.340 --> 16:53.780
Both of you, come at me together.

16:54.180 --> 16:56.120
That way no one can say I bullied
the younger generation.

16:56.120 --> 16:57.300
Do not go back on your word.

16:57.740 --> 16:58.860
Do not worry.

16:59.340 --> 17:00.860
I will make sure we win this round.

17:02.100 --> 17:04.340
Perfect chance to test
the sword technique I just learned.

17:05.300 --> 17:06.620
Be careful.

17:15.860 --> 17:16.980
Watch out.

17:20.080 --> 17:22.019
- Strike the snake at its vital point.
- Mm.

17:22.020 --> 17:26.980
(I will let them make the first move
and wait for a killing opening.)

18:23.180 --> 18:24.660
(Now is my chance.)

18:28.460 --> 18:29.580
(Why did it not work?)

18:29.780 --> 18:31.780
(This is bad. It has locked onto me.)

18:49.900 --> 18:51.020
Jing Tian!

18:54.780 --> 18:55.900
Watch out!

19:08.860 --> 19:09.779
What is going on?

19:09.780 --> 19:11.580
Striking its vital point did nothing.

19:12.700 --> 19:15.259
The last black ring.
It is guarding that spot.

19:15.260 --> 19:16.019
All right.

19:16.020 --> 19:16.979
That is its weak point.

19:16.980 --> 19:18.860
Now! While we still can!

19:31.520 --> 19:33.960
(Afterimage Sword)

19:59.340 --> 20:00.379
Are you all right?

20:00.380 --> 20:01.500
I am fine.

20:06.820 --> 20:09.780
The match is over. Xuejian wins.

20:10.620 --> 20:14.579
Two wins out of three. Xuejian,
you may become the new clan master.

20:14.580 --> 20:15.700
Wait.

20:17.060 --> 20:18.720
(Tang Zhiyun)
Tang Xuejian cannot become

20:18.720 --> 20:20.060
the Tang Clan's clan master.

20:24.950 --> 20:26.229
Unite sword and qi,

20:26.230 --> 20:27.700
ride the sword and soar.

20:27.950 --> 20:28.850
Rise!

20:30.400 --> 20:31.630
It worked!

20:32.620 --> 20:33.790
Jing Tian!

20:54.990 --> 20:58.269
♪War flames rise,
the mountains and rivers tremble♪

20:58.270 --> 21:01.599
♪Reincarnation begins,
cause and effect fall into chaos♪

21:01.600 --> 21:05.249
♪The night grows thick, dark as ink♪

21:05.250 --> 21:08.469
♪The wheel of fate starts
to turn backward♪

21:08.470 --> 21:11.639
♪Crimson palace walls,
stained with blood and tears♪

21:11.640 --> 21:15.289
♪Vows scatter with the wind,
fading into the clouds♪

21:15.290 --> 21:19.019
♪Moonlight cannot pierce this darkness♪

21:19.020 --> 21:25.519
♪Who cries out in loneliness
from the abyss♪

21:25.520 --> 21:28.969
♪The net of destiny tightens ever more♪

21:28.970 --> 21:32.459
♪The lock of karma
binds a lifetime unbroken♪

21:32.460 --> 21:35.849
♪Love and hate entwined beyond escape♪

21:35.850 --> 21:39.249
♪Not awaken in a world of chaos♪

21:39.250 --> 21:42.639
♪Stars shatter, heaven and earth mourn♪

21:42.640 --> 21:46.159
♪Snow fills Shu Mountain,
only ruins remain♪

21:46.160 --> 21:49.489
♪Five elements in balance,
six realms side by side♪

21:49.490 --> 21:52.829
♪All for the sake of the living♪

21:52.830 --> 21:57.640
♪Stepping onto a path of no return♪

22:11.400 --> 22:18.499
(Next episode preview)

22:18.500 --> 22:20.810
Why is Thunder Hall full of demons?

22:31.940 --> 22:34.050
I finally found you.

22:35.340 --> 22:36.500
Brother.
